// Interactive components: hover, press and toggle inside the component
// Shows: interactions placed on variants so every instance behaves without wiring each screen: hover and press with changeTo, a toggle that flips on click, smart animate between variants
// Foundations: semantic colour variables with Light and Dark modes, then text and effect styles. Interface layers bind to these, never to raw hex; literal colours are for artwork and for data series beyond the brand.
